{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792399380, "covers_from": "2026-10-19T08:43:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-19T08:44:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792399440, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-19T08:43:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 41710, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "環境", "content": "民權東路六段巷子的垃圾車班次怎麼一天只有一班啊？對居住在那裡的老人家很不方便。", "display_name": "內湖代表 吳姿瑩", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T08:43:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 6906, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "教育", "content": "有沒有辦法阻止家長或學生濫訴...？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.6,906", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T08:43:18+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 66001, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "觀光", "content": "希望夜市的小吃能多元化，不要都是中國化跟網紅化。那些看起來都不像是台灣的特色。", "display_name": "松山代表 No.66,001", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T08:43:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 22130, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "市長，能不能麻煩解決一下蘭雅國中周遭停車的問題呀？每到晚上，找車位都要找很久，能否增加停車格呢？", "display_name": "士林代表 皓弟", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T08:43:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 4341, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "教育", "content": "低收入戶的孩童，是否能增像外縣市一樣透過民間的合作，讓弱勢兒童能有補習的機會。", "display_name": "信義代表 No.4,341", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 6906, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.6,906", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 66001, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.66,001", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "fr